00:25:55,179 --> 00:25:56,500
[SPEAKER_00]: Endowed in this way, that's it.

375
00:25:56,560 --> 00:26:04,062
[SPEAKER_00]: Endowed in this way, with the seven factors, the nature of a noble disciple has been properly considered for the realization of the fruit of stream-entry.

376
00:26:05,203 --> 00:26:10,384
[SPEAKER_00]: Because, endowed in this way, with seven factors, a noble disciple is endowed with the fruit of stream-entry.

377
00:26:14,506 --> 00:26:23,029
[SPEAKER_00]: It seems to me it's like the... it's a description of the kind of authentic questioning that a sotāpanna

378
00:26:23,978 --> 00:26:32,784
[SPEAKER_01]: Yeah, yeah, but it all starts with that thorough, transparent, wisely considered sense restraint.

379
00:26:34,305 --> 00:26:36,986
[SPEAKER_01]: So, as I said, it doesn't matter if you wear robes or not.

380
00:26:38,187 --> 00:26:43,170
[SPEAKER_01]: In order to discern the obsessed mind as obsessed mind, you need to discern what mind is.

381
00:26:44,171 --> 00:26:45,692
[SPEAKER_01]: You need to be able to withstand

