383
00:26:53,125 --> 00:26:59,712
[SPEAKER_01]: Not through denying the content, but through restraining the loss of perspective through your action.

384
00:26:59,732 --> 00:27:04,317
[SPEAKER_01]: Because when you choose to act out of the content, you forsake the perspective towards the content.

385
