[SPEAKER_01]: You endure the pain because of the bombardment of that which you are restrained against.

388
00:27:25,959 --> 00:27:29,401
[SPEAKER_01]: And today's lay environment is far more proliferated with sensuality.

389
00:27:30,062 --> 00:27:34,004
[SPEAKER_01]: So, if sensory strain is impossible, it's only because they can't bear enough pain.

390
00:27:35,846 --> 00:27:40,368
[SPEAKER_01]: But, the only way to learn how to bear pain is to start bearing the pain.

391
00:27:41,969 --> 00:27:43,790
