00:27:55,476 --> 00:27:58,318
[SPEAKER_01]: Or, you could then, maybe, change the environment.

397
00:27:59,292 --> 00:28:11,320
[SPEAKER_01]: If you can't become a monk or a nun to the point that you can really change the environment that will suit and enable you at least to bear some pain of that sensory strain without being overwhelmed by it, well, then find find something in between.

398
00:28:11,920 --> 00:28:15,662
[SPEAKER_01]: At least withdraw yourself to some extent and then you'll see how much you can bear.

399
00:28:15,963 --> 00:28:18,544
[SPEAKER_01]: You don't know how much you can bear if you never try to bear it.

400
00:28:20,666 --> 00:28:22,567
