[SPEAKER_01]: Towards, against, both towards and against, confusion, obsession of doubt, all of that.

402
00:28:31,716 --> 00:28:45,622
[SPEAKER_01]: But if you, say, a person is able to withstand the sensory strain, to then reflect upon, like, motivation behind your thoughts, speech and actions, because when I'm... in the previous talk we mentioned sensory state, it's not just precepts.

